d Meeting Point. There is only one, and everybody now knows we want it.","kind":"good","cue":"folly-race","at":[34,8]},{"turn":249,"player":5,"text":"The Agreed Meeting Point has begun The Yelling Wall in The Agreed Meeting Point. There is only one: build it first, or not at all.","kind":"info","cue":"folly-race","at":[34,8]},{"turn":250,"player":0,"text":"Peon finishes A Ditch Somebody Fell In.","kind":"good","at":[41,39]},{"turn":250,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch completes Hall of Careful Notes.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":250,"player":1,"text":"Setting Things Alight discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":250,"player":1,"text":"Fire was always available. What is new is doing it to somebody deliberately, from a distance, and then walking away while it continues.","kind":"info"},{"turn":250,"player":1,"text":"Research begins: The Cold Shoulder.","kind":"research"},{"turn":250,"player":4,"text":"Second Meeting Point grows to 10.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":251,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":251,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":251,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":251,"player":0,"text":"Second Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":251,"player":1,"text":"Silverbrook completes Knight.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":251,"player":4,"text":"Second Meeting Point completes Bonebound.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":252,"player":0,"text":"Stabhaven grows to 6.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":252,"player":1,"text":"Duke's Rest has nowhere to put what it just built.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":252,"player":4,"text":"Wanderer finishes A Channel.","kind":"good","at":[37,6]},{"turn":252,"player":4,"text":"Where The Carts Stopped completes Outcast.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":252,"player":4,"text":"Good Enough Crossing completes Slinger.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":253,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":253,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":253,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":253,"player":0,"text":"Second Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":253,"player":4,"text":"Where The Carts Stopped completes Debt Collector.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":254,"player":0,"text":"Peon finishes A Ditch Somebody Fell In.","kind":"good","at":[37,39]},{"turn":254,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind grows to 13.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":254,"player":1,"text":"Deepcell completes Ballista.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":255,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":255,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":255,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":255,"player":0,"text":"Second Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":255,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch grows to 10.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":255,"player":1,"text":"Deepcell completes Ballista.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":255,"player":1,"text":"Duke's Rest has nowhere to put what it just built.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":255,"player":4,"text":"The Long Stay completes Warband.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":256,"player":0,"text":"Insanity discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":256,"player":0,"text":"Happiness, taken one step further than anyone recommended.","kind":"info"},{"turn":256,"player":0,"text":"Now buildable: Considerably Larger Totem, The Long Peace.","kind":"good"},{"turn":256,"player":0,"text":"Research begins: Axes Make You Crazy.","kind":"research"},{"turn":256,"player":1,"text":"Silverbrook completes Two Footmen.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":257,"player":0,"text":"Peon finishes a garrison post.","kind":"good","at":[37,