esser works come first, and it will stand where one of them does. Nobody has been able to get a straight answer about where it is going.","kind":"bad","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":258,"player":4,"text":"Work has begun towards the Circling Caravan. Nobody is entirely sure who agreed to it, and the schedule has been posted anyway. Two works in any settlement, then the Caravan itself where one of them stands.","kind":"good","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":258,"player":5,"text":"The Agreed Meeting Point has begun work towards something called a Circling Caravan. Two lesser works come first, and it will stand where one of them does. Nobody has been able to get a straight answer about where it is going.","kind":"bad","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":259,"player":1,"text":"Duke's Rest has nowhere to put what it just built.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":259,"player":4,"text":"Good Enough Crossing grows to 8.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":259,"player":4,"text":"Good Enough Crossing completes Warband.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":260,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch completes Hall of Cross-Referenced Notes.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":260,"player":1,"text":"Silverbrook completes Archer.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":260,"player":1,"text":"Deepcell grows to 10.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":260,"player":1,"text":"Fairhaven completes Ballista.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":260,"player":1,"text":"Duke's Rest grows to 8.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":260,"player":1,"text":"Duke's Rest has nowhere to put what it just built.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":261,"player":1,"text":"Duke's Rest completes Cathedral of Firm Conviction.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":261,"player":2,"text":"The Queen holds against Warband.","kind":"combat","at":[24,23],"actor":194},{"turn":261,"player":4,"text":"Warband is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[24,22]},{"turn":261,"player":2,"text":"The Queen holds against Slinger.","k